<metadata><name>Snowlands 0404 Bradley Hut Loop</name><desc>lollipop (loop from waypoint 5, stem retraced). 11.2 miles round trip. Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/04/0404_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
